I’ve prepared a README snippet and example test cases you can add to the repo to describe how to test the XSS protections. I’ll provide:

- A README snippet that explains manual testing and automated tests.
- Example Jest test cases (server-side) to verify the sanitize middleware strips dangerous tags and preserves allowed content.
